\title{tidybrregmcp: Model Context Protocol Server Derived from 'tidybrreg'}
\description{
Exposes the exported functions of 'tidybrreg' as Model Context Protocol (MCP) tools. The tool catalogue, every tool's title, description, argument documentation and input schema are derived at run time from the installed 'tidybrreg' namespace and its help pages, so the server changes exactly when 'tidybrreg' changes and adds no interpretation of the register's data of its own: tools return the tibbles 'tidybrreg' returns, with its column names, its codes, its attributes and its typed conditions. Serves over standard streams or streamable HTTP.
